        "description": "Xiaomi uses a multi-brand strategy with distinct naming conventions. The main Xiaomi brand uses number series (e.g., Xiaomi 14) for flagships, with 'Pro' and 'Ultra' for higher-end variants and 'T' for a value flagship series. 'MIX' denotes experimental and foldable devices, while 'Civi' targets the lifestyle/selfie segment. Redmi uses number series for entry-level, 'Note' for mid-range, 'K' for flagship (China-exclusive), 'A' for ultra-budget, and 'Turbo' for performance. POCO uses 'F' for flagships, 'X' for upper mid-range, 'M' for budget, and 'C' for entry-level. 'Lite', 'SE', and 'Youth' are used for lower-specced variants within a series."
